flowchart TD
    U[User: Web App / Browser Extension] --> FE[Next.js Frontend]
    FE --> API[FastAPI Backend]
    API --> AUTH[Auth: Keycloak]
    API --> FETCH[Policy Fetcher: Playwright + trafilatura]
    FETCH --> CLEAN[Text Cleaner and Clause Splitter]
    CLEAN --> LANG[Language Detect: fastText]
    LANG --> MT[NLLB-200: Translate to English]
    MT --> CLS[Privacy Clause Classifier: fine-tuned DeBERTa-v3]
    MT --> EMB[Embeddings: bge-m3]
    EMB --> VDB[(Qdrant Vector DB)]
    LAW[(GDPR, CCPA, DPDP, LGPD Legal Texts)] --> VDB
    CLS --> LLM[Llama 3.1 8B / Qwen2.5 via Ollama or vLLM]
    VDB -->|RAG: region-specific rights| LLM
    LLM --> LABEL[Privacy Label Generator: grade A-F + rights]
    LABEL --> TR[NLLB-200: Translate to User Language]
    TR --> API
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL: users, saved reports, policy versions)]
    DB --> DIFF[Policy Change Monitor: cron + diff]
    DIFF --> API
    API --> FE
